 a battery?\n\nTemperature can have a major impact on battery performance. But sodium-ion technology is showing promising results in extreme environments.\n\nThe latest generation of sodium-ion cells can retain around 90% of their nominal capacity at https://t.co/WuZWmxeUkH", "url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2119823579575697462"}, {"author_id": "1244170669970968576", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:43:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120059837178683818"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "CATL chairman said sodium-ion batteries offer sufficient range for daily urban travel, while more swap stations can ease concerns about longer trips.", "display_url": "cnev.co/l7kwuBF", "end": 257, "expanded_url": "https://cnev.co/l7kwuBF", "images": [{"height": 900, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120059838063595520/H0KtuZFc?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120059838063595520/H0KtuZFc?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 234, "status": 200, "title": "CATL says expanding swap network will help accelerate sodium-ion battery adoption", "unwound_url": "https://cnevpost.com/2026/11/10/catl-swap-network-help-sodium-ion-adoption/", "url": "https://t.co/m7PCsTeZzq"}]}, "id": "2120059837178683818", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1978, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CATL says expanding swap network will help accelerate sodium-ion battery adoption\n\nCATL chairman said sodium-ion batteries offer sufficient range for daily urban travel, while more swap stations can ease concerns about longer trips.  https://t.co/m7PCsTeZzq  👇", "url": "https://x.com/CnEVPost/status/2120059837178683818"}, {"author_id": "925031952637247488", "created_at": "2026-11-09T10:30:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119739310165406023"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/RWg1rr7wlM", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/svsolarvision/status/2119739310165406023/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119739307061608449", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/RWg1rr7wlM"}]}, "id": "2119739310165406023", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China is providing a temporary tax advantage to sodium-ion batteries as manufacturers transition the technology toward commercial electric vehicle applications. Hina Battery, a prominent developer in the sector, has announced plans for a 10 GWh production facility in Wuhan. The https://t.co/RWg1rr7wlM", "url": "https://x.com/svsolarvision/status/2119739310165406023"}, {"author_id": "2029168795663908867", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:29:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119588082664038827"], "id": "2119588082664038827", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Alfen plans a large CATL sodium-ion BESS demonstrator for H2 2027, CEO Michael Colijn said in a Nov 5 interview, testing grid integration, inverter behavior and software. Backdrop: the pair's 5 GWh sodium-ion deal from Jul 16, 2026 (2027+, Netherlands &amp; Western Europe).", "url": "https://x.com/bobozhong13/status/2119588082664038827"}, {"author_id": "956093498331140096", "created_at": "2026-11-09T22:11:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119915730913415451"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 247, "start": 232, "tag": "BatteryStorage"}, {"end": 258, "start": 248, "tag": "Australia"}, {"end": 270, "start": 259, "tag": "PVProjects"}]}, "id": "2119915730913415451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 526, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sodium-ion batteries approach cost parity with LFP, with 70 GWh covered by supply agreements: Sodium-ion batteries are approaching cell-level cost parity with LFP technology, with supply agreements exceeding 70 GWh… dlvr.​it/TWGKv5 #BatteryStorage #Australia #PVProjects", "url": "https://x.com/pvmagazineoz/status/2119915730913415451"}, {"author_id": "1121471431873847299", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:13:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119825739222814768"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 151, "start": 139, "tag": "DataCenters"}, {"end": 165, "start": 152, "tag": "GridCapacity"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/business/statu…", "end": 189, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/business/status/2119746860256543067", "start": 166, "url": "https://t.co/hfXMQ9GI9B"}]}, "id": "2119825739222814768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119746860256543067", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grid interconnection capacity is increasingly the engineering constraint that decides where and when new data center load can come online. #DataCenters #GridCapacity https://t.co/hfXMQ9GI9B", "url": "https://x.com/ReviewingNews/status/2119825739222814768"}, {"author_id": "1900424785835741184", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:25:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120055288384352347"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/infra_marginal…", "end": 53, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/infra_marginal/status/2119169267296071830", "start": 30, "url": "https://t.co/0fVxolW7zq"}]}, "id": "2120055288384352347", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119169267296071830", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Sodium-ion batteries... soon. https://t.co/0fVxolW7zq", "url": "https://x.com/Blue_Team_78/status/2120055288384352347"}, {"author_id": "1812584227114000384", "created_at": "2026-11-10T05:54:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120032331968770049"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 227, "start": 215, "tag": "DataCenters"}, {"end": 231, "start": 228, "tag": "AI"}], "urls": [{"description": "The agreement secures 1.7GW of gas-fired generators and installation work for Anthropic’s AI data centres, using orders already placed by a Texas supplier.", "display_url": "mezha.net/eng/news/mezha…", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://mezha.net/eng/news/mezha-5ea29f7e53fe0f14dde186b6_anthropic_takes_over/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120032338402746368/VTAk94Sh?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120032338402746368/VTAk94Sh?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 244, "status": 200, "title": "Anthropic takes over $3.4 billion Caterpillar generator orders | Межа", "unwound_url": "https://mezha.net/eng/news/mezha-5ea29f7e53fe0f14dde186b6_anthropic_takes_over/", "url": "https://t.co/GC74S3aiBG"}]}, "id": "2120032331968770049", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI data center strategy is changing fast: when grid interconnection takes years, developers are buying generation first and solving utility power later. Speed-to-power now means fuel, permitting, and OPEX risk too. #DataCenters #AI\n\nRead more: https://t.co/GC74S3aiBG", "url": "https://x.com/MrDataCenters/status/2120032331968770049"}, {"author_id": "1238033165899489280", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:30:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147033117835552"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kArjGsBX2b", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ModoEnergy/status/2120147033117835552/video/1", "media_key": "7_2120146970354278400", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/kArjGsBX2b"}]}, "id": "2120147033117835552", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 270, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Sodium-ion has a pipeline problem.\n\n~10 GWh of sodium-ion BESS projects are in development, almost all in China. The total battery pipeline is ~3.5 TWh.\n\nOver 1 GWh of those projects was cancelled this year, roughly a 10% cancellation rate, and developers switched to lithium-ion. https://t.co/kArjGsBX2b", "url": "https://x.com/ModoEnergy/status/2120147033117835552"}, {"author_id": "1395550625409105920", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:33:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119876068110922108"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Sodium-ion batteries are moving into electric vehicles and grid storage. But can the emerging technology compete with lithium-ion in 2026?", "display_url": "interestingengineering.com/energy/sodium-…", "end": 49, "expanded_url": "https://interestingengineering.com/energy/sodium-ion-vs-lithium-ion-batteries-2026", "images": [{"height": 1080, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119876072603111424/7MJ8cz2X?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119876072603111424/7MJ8cz2X?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 26, "status": 200, "title": "Sodium-ion vs. lithium-ion: Tracking the battery race in 2026", "unwound_url": "https://interestingengineering.com/energy/sodium-ion-vs-lithium-ion-batteries-2026", "url": "https://t.co/Hb1WpM072A"}]}, "id": "2119876068110922108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "hopefully soon sodium ion\nhttps://t.co/Hb1WpM072A", "url": "https://x.com/CAVATAR23/status/2119876068110922108"}, {"author_id": "1085245460825149443", "created_at": "2026-11-10T08:55:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120077943233794521"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/edcporter/stat…", "end": 96, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/edcporter/status/2120065846513123633", "start": 73, "url": "https://t.co/ue9DB4NjF8"}]}, "id": "2120077943233794521", "public_metrics": {"